Market Segmentation
The rack-based coolant distribution units market is segmented by cooling technology and application.

By Type: Liquid-to-Air CDU; Liquid-to-Liquid CDU.
By Application: Data Centers; High-Performance Computing; AI and GPU Computing; Enterprise Computing Infrastructure.

Liquid-to-air CDUs transfer heat from the liquid cooling loop to an air-based heat rejection system and can offer comparatively straightforward installation. Liquid-to-liquid CDUs transfer heat to another liquid circuit, making them suitable for facilities designed around advanced liquid-cooling infrastructure.

Data centers represent the core application, while AI and HPC deployments are increasing the need for cooling systems that can accommodate high thermal loads and dense computing configurations.

